  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v4-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "89ef492edf8cb668b2b1152c7354dd552babff046686728c0c5c15132805ec89",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a4b973eae3b4da95c3f37efd6b02578c13f18e67e08f05684f71b04170b1e497",
      "text": "悟空\n学滑冰",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f085042badd193e697e7010244e22c0386b66911f96fbdba31045c04621ea662",
      "text": "悟空看着大家滑来滑去。\n“看！会飞的脚！”\n“我也想试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09429c67b1215c4aaccbed13e17f8802bc4f1d86542823cc9d1eb4201e942a99",
      "text": "他穿上冰鞋。\n咚，咚。\n“我的脚上长了小雪橇！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98f5de420e878cff3b89d2ba4417679f78f7fb85024678fd28cbb1e064e53918",
      "text": "戴好头盔，戴好手套。\n水獭教练检查好冰鞋。\n“准备好迈小步了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dfb35d45c4195f3cff5bed96decd193af413421ce89286230b14edcb4d26a985",
      "text": "悟空走上冰面。\n两只脚滑开了。\n“脚呀，等等我！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "48aff46cf59ec9a8e4f0b05680d8de12675010d83801a95571cf0a8737a58686",
      "text": "哎哟！他摔了一跤。\n一屁股坐在冰上。\n“你好呀，凉凉的地板。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "683efd063573ed9c57ee21702674015f39bc653275b28e7ea8c0bdb9eb04bb2a",
      "text": "“学东西要多练习。”\n水獭教练说，\n“我们一起站起来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8c8c3af306e844451a6b9c86be98efc74e8bf52383cb9d746ebbf4bdaf9f6815",
      "text": "迈小步，弯膝盖。\n“像小企鹅！”玉兔说。\n悟空一摇一摆，咯咯直笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89e153f38d629cc985eba4f95729fdc1e9a2bc9831445ef0f1464e89fdf74f44",
      "text": "蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n滑出去一点点！\n又滑出去一点点！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0cc63fac3382f457cb3c0c062c513ca5a034c5d2c80c4d6c618a1c0a6bc84164",
      "text": "接着，他又摔了一跤。\n“我还以为已经学会了呢。”\n他坐到八戒旁边。\n“和我一起歇歇吧。”八戒说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "415d8f88a2285cdac009ceb8541d5962c4212a1d01f53af6620f7b304d53f5d7",
      "text": "他们搓搓小手，\n看雪花轻轻地转着圈。\n“我要再试一次。”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "de54d2ce50f1a181cd33d0b45b8beb1b937b496d732fe6b2cd96e3345989b8c1",
      "text": "悟空回到冰上，接着练。\n迈一小步，滑一小下，\n摇摇晃晃也没关系。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a5cc2a6e85cf3df35fac3e431af390208aa2d21a8aa93c1c792055808f28db9",
      "text": "慢慢地，他的脚找到了节奏。\n蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n“看！我会滑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b4f9cb1b69525aa2d9c0234b89a4b1cd6cd91c44a887483dc5e72dc2169c8aea",
      "text": "他们慢慢滑着，绕了个圈。\n玉兔带头，八戒跟上，\n悟空也滑起来。\n六只冰鞋，滑得真开心！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "65e914a26514b14bf68d393b6cb58eff668e1712818eb594da50322600ee212a",
      "text": "冰场的灯一闪一闪。\n“冰面，下次见！”\n他的脚累了，\n可他还在笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b43dc28008db333f301eb42002d0b95f8c2a344aabc87b7daade9b6b21ce18fe",
      "text": "悟空钻进被子里。\n梦里，\n他滑过一颗颗星星，\n慢慢地，轻轻地，\n一直滑进梦乡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
